shots.description:
S02 BOTANICALS (frames 75-135). 100 mm macro at f/2, lens at bench height. A 12 cm motion-control slide left to right, with the focus plane travelling along:
- star anise, quills of cinnamon bark, green cardamom pods;
- dusty-blue juniper with its waxy bloom, threads of saffron;
- dried chamomile, a curl of bitter-orange peel with white pith;
- gnarled licorice root, ginger slices, a slope of poppy seeds.

Raking east sun from frame left throws long shadows. Dark out-of-focus foreground heaps pass the lens as natural wipes.

Super 'WOLFENBÜTTEL · GERMANY [1934]' types on at 3.0. VO 1 continues.

S04 MACERATION TIME-LAPSE (frames 180-225). 85 mm at f/4, locked off on the shoulder of a tall maceration jar. A linen bag of botanicals hangs in clear spirit.

Three days flicker past in under two seconds:
- the mullion shadows swing across the bench;
- two brief blue nights;
- the spirit deepens from clear, to amber, to dark mahogany.
The light carries real time-lapse exposure flicker.
